<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's April wholesale prices -0.2 pct, +3.2 yr.</title>
<headline>Morocco's April wholesale prices -0.2 pct, +3.2 yr.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Statistics Directorate on Tuesday issued the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>    MOROCCO'S CONSUMER PRICES: April 97    March 97</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)    -0.2	  -0.5</p>
<p>    Year/year average change    +3.2	  +3.3</p>
<p>(Basis= 1977) This variation is attributed to a slight drop in the agriculture activity, the directorate said.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
</text>
